      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a decent start, but i just ran it through our sentiment tool and the positivity score is actually kind of low (around 0.45). i think it's because the middle section focuses a bit too much on the \"lifeless\" and \"devastating\" parts.\n\ncan you try another version? we need to see that score climb up into the 0.7 or 0.8 range to get board approval. but again, REALLY important: please don't just start spamming happy adjectives or making it sound like a fairy tale. that's what i'm worried about. keep the gravity of the situation there, but try to frame the hope and the impact of the donation in a way that hits that higher sentiment score. just keep it professional.",
